            "level": {
              "value": 5
            },
            "description": {
              "value": "You create a tune so catchy, your foes can't help but dance along.\n\nAttempt a Performance check against the Will DCs of all enemies in a 30-foot emanation.\n\n- **Critical Success:** The target takes a –10-foot status penalty to its Speed and is flat-footed, both for 1 round.\n- **Success:** The target takes a –5-foot status penalty to its Speed for 1 round.\n- **Critical Failure:** The target is temporarily immune for 1 hour."
            }
          }
        }
      ]
